  "description": "Archaeologist Asher Bride boards a train in search of a long-sought artifact, only to encounter Isaac Groom, a mysterious passenger obsessed with him. Asher attempts to distance himself from Isaac's inexplicable interest. However, this is no ordinary train. As they journey through various time periods from past to future on this diesel locomotive, Asher begins to recover memories he had lost.\n\n[Official English](https://comics.inkr.com/title/4670-time-train)",
